{
  "text": "```verilog\nmodule data_sync #(\n    parameter STAGES = 2,\n    parameter DWIDTH = 8\n)(\n    input                  clk,\n    input                  rstn,\n    input  [DWIDTH-1:0]    din,\n    input                  dready_i,\n    output reg [DWIDTH-1:0] dout,\n    output reg             dready_o\n);\n\n    localparam SYNC_STAGES = (STAGES < 2) ? 2 : STAGES;\n\n    reg [SYNC_STAGES-1:0] sync_reg;\n    reg [SYNC_STAGES-1:0] valid_reg;\n\n    integer i;\n\n    always @(posedge clk or negedge rstn) begin\n        if (!rstn) begin\n            sync_reg <= {SYNC_STAGES{1'b0}};\n            valid_reg <= {SYNC_STAGES{1'b0}};\n            dout <= {DWIDTH{1'b0}};\n            dready_o <= 1'b0;\n        end else begin\n            sync_reg[0] <= dready_i;\n            valid_reg[0] <= dready_i;\n\n            for (i = 1; i < SYNC_STAGES; i = i + 1) begin\n                sync_reg[i] <= sync_reg[i-1];\n                valid_reg[i] <= valid_reg[i-1];\n            end\n\n            if (valid_reg[SYNC_STAGES-1]) begin\n                dout <= din;\n                dready_o <= 1'b1;\n            end else begin\n                dready_o <= 1'b0;\n            end\n        end\n    end\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
